          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಾಕ್ಷ್ಯಚಿತ್ರ (sākṣyacitra) is borrowed from Sanskrit, a modern compound of sākṣya, \"evidence\" (CDIAL 13322), and citra, \"bright, a picture\" (CDIAL 4803)."
