              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆ ಕುಖ್ಯಾತ ಕಳ್ಳನನ್ನು ಕೊನೆಗೆ ಪೊಲೀಸರು ಹಿಡಿದರು. ā kukhyāta kaḷḷanannu konege polīsaru hiḍidaru. The police finally caught that notorious thief."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕು-, bad, and ಖ್ಯಾತ, known: well known for bad deeds. ಪ್ರಖ್ಯಾತ is famous."
            }
          ]
